The `agentperf_tuning` dataset (50 trajectory JSON files under
`trajectories/`) is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
("Apache-2.0"). See the root of the Arc engine repository for the
full Apache-2.0 license text.

Each trajectory's `source` field attributes representative file
snippets back to their originating public, permissively-licensed
repository. The aggregate list is in `licenses/SOURCES.txt`. Snippets
are short enough to fall under fair-use for benchmarking purposes
and are always attributed.

If you are the maintainer of a referenced repository and would like
attribution corrected, or a snippet removed, please open an issue
against `github.com/aeonmindai/arc`.
